Add VxWorks support for the dlopen RTLD_* flags in libloading.

libloading hardcodes RTLD_{LAZY,NOW,GLOBAL,LOCAL} per-OS via cfg_if and has
no VxWorks arm, so it hits compile_error! on VxWorks. The WR libc defines
RTLD_LAZY=1, RTLD_NOW=2, RTLD_GLOBAL=0x100, RTLD_LOCAL=0. Add vxworks to the
matching arms (and a dedicated LOCAL=0 arm).
